# movies attribution map (generated by addNewContent/04_build_dataset.py); tracked despite *.json
!data/movies_map.json

# addNewContent pipeline:
#  - out/        : generated screenshots staged for upload to DigitalOcean (large)
#  - seinfeld/, movies/ : staged source video corpora + extracted sidecar .srt (multi-GB, local only)
# The pipeline code (pipeline/*.py, 0*.py), arial.ttf and README ARE tracked.
addNewContent/out/
addNewContent/seinfeld/
addNewContent/movies/
*.srt
__pycache__/